  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>While you meditate, as a (control) talent you gain either a +2 bonus to your natural armor which doesn't stack with other sources of natural armor or a +2 enhancement bonus to your natural armor, increasing by 1 for every 5 ranks in the associated skill you possess.</p>\n<p>In addition, as a (clarity) talent you may gain this bonus until the beginning of your next turn and an equal amount of DR/—.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/body-control#toc41\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
